@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@access = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.org","password":"REPLACE_ME"}

### Analytics
GET {{base}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Smart filter
GET {{base}}/students?query=группа:ЭФБО-07-24%20долг:да&page=0&size=25&sort=lastName,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
